// The rest of pack_body -- writing the escaped literal and the tail --
// split out to keep pack_body under the action limit.

pack_body_b(string es, string src, int nxt, int k) {
  put(es);
  pack_tail(src, nxt, k);
} return void;
("hi", "hi", 2, 0):() then calls pack_tail:("hi", 2, 0)
("bye", "hello", 2, 0):() then calls pack_tail:("hello", 2, 0)
